@startuml

[*] --> Stopped
Stopped --> Idle: (1) Start
Stopped --> Running: (2) Start
Idle --> Stopped: (3) Stop
Idle --> Running: (4) LoadPart
Idle --> Running: (5) UnloadPart
Idle --> Idle: (6) LoadPart
Running --> Running: (7) UnloadPart
Running --> Running: (8) LoadPart
Running --> Running: (9) ProcessFinished
Running --> Idle: (10) ProcessFinished 
Running --> Stopping: (11) Stop
Running --> Stopped: (12) Abort
Stopping --> Stopping: (13) UnloadPart
Stopping --> Stopped: (14) ProcessFinished

note as N1
  (1):\tSignal::Start [inport_empty()]
  (2):\tSignal::Start [!inport_empty() && outport_free()]
  (3):\tSignal::Stop
  (4):\tSignal::LoadPart(part) [inport_free() && process_empty() && outport.free()]
  (5):\tSignal::UnloadPart() [!inport_empty() && process_empty() && outport.free() ]
  (6):\tSignal::LoadPart(part) [inport_free() && (! process_empty() || ! outport.free())]
  (7):\tSignal::UnoadPart
  (8):\tSignal::LoadPart(part)
  (9):\tSignal::ProcessFinished [ ! inport_empty() ]
  (10):\tSignal::ProcessFinished [ inport_empty() ]
  (11):\tSignal::Stop
  (12):\tSignal::Abort
  (13):\tSignal::UnloadPart
  (14):\tSignal::ProcessFinished
end note
@enduml